        \end{tikzpicture}
      </latex-image>
  </image>
</figure>
  

<p>
  49 believe that apples are the best.
This means n(A) = 49.
We already labeled E and A to indicate n(E and A) = 42.
Therefore, the right hand crescent shape of circle A will need to have
7 elements, to make a total of 49 elements in circle A.
</p>

